<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Painel Administrativo - Agro Giuss</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/estilos-sistema.css">
    <style>
        /* ── Layout geral do painel admin ── */
        body { background: #f0fdf4; }

        .admin-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            background: #fff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .admin-header-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }
        .admin-header-logo {
            height: 36px;
        }
        .admin-header-info h2 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #18181b;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .admin-header-info span {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #71717a;
        }
        .admin-btn-voltar {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border: 1.5px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #3f3f46;
            background: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: border-color .2s, color .2s;
        }
        .admin-btn-voltar:hover { border-color: #38b049; color: #38b049; }

        /* ── Área central ── */
        .admin-main {
            min-height: calc(100vh - 65px - 48px);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 48px 20px;
        }
        .admin-login-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 440px 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 880px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* ── Card do formulário ── */
        .admin-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 36px 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
        }
        .admin-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: #f0fdf4;
            color: #15803d;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            border-radius: 99px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .admin-card-title {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #18181b;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .admin-card-sub {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #71717a;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        /* Erro */
        .admin-erro {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            color: #dc2626;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        /* Campos */
        .admin-field {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .admin-field label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #18181b;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
        }
        .admin-input-wrap {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .admin-input-wrap svg.field-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 12px;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .admin-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px 14px 10px 38px;
            border: 1.5px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #18181b;
            background: #fff;
            transition: border-color .2s;
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        .admin-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #38b049;
        }
        .admin-input::placeholder { color: #a1a1aa; }

        /* Botão mostrar senha */
        .btn-toggle-senha {
            position: absolute;
            right: 12px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #38b049;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        .btn-toggle-senha:hover { color: #2fa03f; }

        /* Checkbox manter conectado */
        .admin-check-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .admin-check-row input[type="checkbox"] {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            accent-color: #38b049;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .admin-check-row label {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #3f3f46;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* Botão entrar */
        .admin-btn-entrar {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px;
            background: #38b049;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: background .2s;
            font-family: inherit;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .admin-btn-entrar:hover { background: #2fa03f; }

        /* Recuperar acesso */
        .admin-recover {
            border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
            padding-top: 18px;
        }
        .admin-recover a {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #38b049;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .admin-recover a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .admin-recover p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #71717a;
            margin-top: 4px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ── Lado direito: mascote ── */
        .admin-mascot-col {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 0 8px;
        }
        .admin-mascot-img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 300px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            background: #fff;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .admin-mascot-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #18181b;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .admin-mascot-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #52525b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .admin-mascot-alert {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 10px;
            background: #f0fdf4;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
        }
        .admin-mascot-alert svg { flex-shrink: 0; color: #38b049; margin-top: 2px; }
        .admin-mascot-alert strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #15803d;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }
        .admin-mascot-alert p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #3f3f46;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .admin-footer {
            padding: 14px 32px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .admin-footer span {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        /* Responsivo */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .admin-login-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .admin-mascot-col { display: none; }
            .admin-header { padding: 12px 16px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header class="admin-header">
        <div class="admin-header-left">
            <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Agro Giuss" class="admin-header-logo">
            <div class="admin-header-info">
                <h2>Painel administrativo</h2>
                <span>Agro Giuss</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/" class="admin-btn-voltar">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Voltar ao site
        </a>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN -->
    <main class="admin-main">
        <div class="admin-login-grid">

            <!-- CARD FORMULÁRIO -->
            <div class="admin-card">
                <div class="admin-badge">
                    <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
                    </svg>
                    Área restrita
                </div>
                <h1 class="admin-card-title">Acesso administrativo</h1>
                <p class="admin-card-sub">Use suas credenciais de administrador para entrar no painel da Agro Giuss.</p>

                <% if (typeof erro !== 'undefined' && erro) { %>
                <div class="admin-erro">
                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                        <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
                        <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
                    </svg>
                    <%= erro %>
                </div>
                <% } %>

                <form action="/admin/login" method="POST">
                    <!-- Campo: email ou usuário -->
                    <div class="admin-field">
                        <label for="identificador">E-mail ou usuário</label>
                        <div class="admin-input-wrap">
                            <svg class="field-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
                            </svg>
                            <input
                                type="text"
                                id="identificador"
                                name="identificador"
                                class="admin-input"
                                placeholder="Digite seu e-mail ou usuário"
                                required
                                autofocus
                                value="<%= typeof identificador !== 'undefined' ? identificador : '' %>"
                            >
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Campo: senha -->
                    <div class="admin-field">
                        <label for="senha">Senha</label>
                        <div class="admin-input-wrap">
                            <svg class="field-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                                <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
                            </svg>
                            <input
                                type="password"
                                id="senha"
                                name="senha"
                                class="admin-input"
                                placeholder="Digite sua senha"
                                required
                            >
                            <button type="button" class="btn-toggle-senha" onclick="toggleSenha()">Mostrar</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Manter conectado -->
                    <div class="admin-check-row">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="manter" name="manter">
                        <label for="manter">Manter conectado</label>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="admin-btn-entrar">
                        Entrar no painel
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
                        </svg>
                    </button>

                    <div class="admin-recover">
                        <a href="#">Precisa recuperar seu acesso?</a>
                        <p>Entre em contato com o responsável pelo painel para redefinir sua senha ou verificar sua permissão.</p>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>

            <!-- MASCOTE / LADO DIREITO -->
            <div class="admin-mascot-col">
                <img src="/img/fazendeiro-figma.png" alt="Fazendeiro Agro Giuss" class="admin-mascot-img"
                     onerror="this.src='/img/fazendeiro.png'">
                <h2 class="admin-mascot-title">Tudo para o campo.<br>Gestão em um só lugar.</h2>
                <p class="admin-mascot-text">Acesse o painel para gerenciar estoque, usuários, categorias e produtos da Agro Giuss.</p>
                <div class="admin-mascot-alert">
                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Exclusivo para a equipe autorizada</strong>
                        <p>Este acesso é diferente da conta de cliente. As permissões são concedidas pelo responsável pelo painel.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="admin-footer">
        <span>Agro Giuss &bull; Painel administrativo</span>
        <span>
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
            </svg>
            Não compartilhe suas credenciais.
        </span>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function toggleSenha() {
            const input = document.getElementById('senha');
            const btn = document.querySelector('.btn-toggle-senha');
            if (input.type === 'password') {
                input.type = 'text';
                btn.textContent = 'Ocultar';
            } else {
                input.type = 'password';
                btn.textContent = 'Mostrar';
            }
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>

